# UPI Tracker Mobile Environment Configuration
# When testing locally with Expo Go on the same Wi-Fi network, leave EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL commented/blank
# (the app will automatically connect to your computer's IP: http://<your-ip>:5000/api).

# When deploying your backend to production (e.g. Render, Railway, AWS, DigitalOcean),
# uncomment and set your live API URL:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-backend-domain.com/api
